  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Post-Earthquake Hospitals Reconstruction Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project aims to support T&#xfc;rkiye&apos;s efforts towards the rapid delivery of health facilities and services to improve the quality of life of the earthquake-affected population. The Project Development Objective (PDO) is to support T&#xfc;rkiye&apos;s efforts towards rapidly delivering health services to the earthquake-affected population by establishing 13 Hospitals with green, resilient, and sustainable measures.  In addition to supporting the government&apos;s &#x2018;build back better&#x2019; initiative, the hospitals are envisaged to increase the health services delivery capacity, access to healthcare facilities, and preparedness-coordination capacity of the healthcare sector against future disasters and events. IsDB&#x2019;s financial contribution will be utilized for construction of a 250-bed capacity hospital in the Kahramanmara&#x15f; province.</narrative>
  </description>
